    "source": {
      "value": "crb"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "There's a rage deep inside you that sometimes breaks loose, granting you some of the might of a barbarian in addition to your other abilities.\n\nThe barbarian archetype is a great choice for characters that emphasize Strength and melee attacks more than usual for their class, as long as they can handle Rage's spellcasting restriction. It's especially good for characters looking to add more damage."
    },
